## Self-exclusion note

Zero verified public benchmark numbers were found for this exact model/ID (`MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-Preview`) as of 2026-10-01: official MiniMax platform docs publish specs but no benchmark table; the MiniMax M3 landing page and blog publish benchmarks (BrowseComp 83.5, PostTrainBench 37.1) for MiniMax-M3, a different model — those numbers are deliberately NOT applied here; CloudPrice does not track the model; Bing/DuckDuckGo/Startpage/Brave/Mojeek searches surfaced no third-party benchmark posts. Saved as `.md.excluded` per the mandatory self-exclusion rule (`RULES.md`, `model-report-TEMPLATE.md`): no scores computed, no placeholder numbers invented. The spec facts above are vendor-verified and may be reused once benchmark data appears.

